&lt;p&gt;Caching is fundamental in building fast and reliable systems, and in .NET there are multiple ways to do that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this talk we&amp;rsquo;ll explore the ins and outs of caching in .NET, from memory to distributed up to hybrid caching: we&amp;rsquo;ll see both the new HybridCache from Microsoft and FusionCache.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>